cwOn('cwPsDvSaveGo',()=>{const v=cwRead('cwPsDS',[{n:'name',l:'Name',req:true}]);if(!v)return;state.cw.psSaved.push({id:cwId('SS'),name:v.name,f:{kw:cwF('cwPs:dvkw',''),sub:cwF('cwPs:dvsub',''),st:cwF('cwPs:dvst','Any stage'),min:cwF('cwPs:dvmin','')}});ui.modal=null;cwPersist('Search saved.')});
